id: pm-web-ulgy
title: Cover the routes/pm.ts command surface and the index/server bootstrap in pm-web
description: "Stage 2 of pm-web-9ulj, tracked separately because routes/pm.ts is 2704 lines at 7.08% function coverage and is far larger than the rest of the route layer combined. It proxies the pm CLI for every item operation, and memory of this codebase records two traps that only real-workspace tests can catch: runPm serves most actions in-process via the SDK, so unmapped positionals are silently dropped unless added to POSITIONAL_KEYS and a fake-pm-binary harness cannot observe it at all; and the --folder parameter honours '..', which without the isSafeTypeFolder guard writes items outside the pm root and is cross-tenant on the hosted deployment. Also covers src/index.ts (42.83% lines, 26.32% functions) and src/server.ts (42.31%, 0% functions). Depends on the stage 1 harness landing first."
type: Task
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-07-29T17:26:40.207Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-18T03:28:08.122Z"
assignee: pi-agent
claim_principal: pi-agent
author: codex
estimated_minutes: 1800
acceptance_criteria: routes/pm.ts is exercised against a real pm workspace rather than a fake pm binary so in-process SDK dispatch is observable; a regression test asserts that a '..' folder traversal is rejected and that items never land outside the pm root; POSITIONAL_KEYS coverage proves no positional is silently dropped; index.ts and server.ts bootstrap paths are covered; thresholds ratchet again
parent: pm-web-9ulj
comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-18T03:12:09.394Z",pi-agent,"Baseline npm run coverage: 395/395 tests pass; aggregate src coverage L/B/F 71.06/81.28/65.71. Per-file baseline is captured in the coverage run for this branch; largest gaps are routes/pm.ts 30.67/58.95/14.41, index.ts 52.40/94.59/30.00, routes/github.ts 45.63/71.79/35.71, routes/oidc.ts 48.00/100.00/22.22, server.ts 62.79/33.33/33.33, and db.ts 37.56/70.00/66.67."
  "2026-09-18T03:12:10.032Z",pi-agent,"Scope note: public/src is intentionally excluded from this PR's coverage gate and is currently unmeasured. It contains 14,884 TypeScript source lines by find public/src -type f -name '*.ts' | xargs wc -l."
  "2026-09-18T03:28:07.103Z",pi-agent,"Milestone: added real loopback HTTP + real PostgreSQL + real temporary pm workspace coverage. Client B now opens the production SSE endpoint and observes client A's create event. Two edit collaborators concurrently PATCH distinct fields on one item; both writes survive and every history JSONL row parses, with both messages present. A lifecycle scenario exercises rich create, reads, updates, comments, notes, append/history, dependencies, relationships, status views, close/delete, authorization misses, validation errors, and missing-item failures."
  "2026-09-18T03:28:07.561Z",pi-agent,"Measured after npm run coverage: 398/398 pass; aggregate src L/B/F 76.82/80.06/73.00 (baseline 71.06/81.28/65.71). Ratcheted declared floors to L/B/F 76/80/73; branch floor remains at 80 rather than weakening. Remaining uncovered source lines by file: app.ts 77-78,93-94,153-156,182-183,219-221; auth.ts 10-11; board.ts 49; db.ts 20-27,86-205; health.ts 117-118,222-226,355-365; index.ts 27-30,182-185,196-211,214-236,239-249,251-254,268-279,290-299,311-319,344-399,415-435,451-505,521-582; oidc.ts 136-138,161-162,164-165,170-171,229-230,238-239,299-300,315-316,318-319,327-328,404-405,434-435,441-442,444-445,451-452,567-572; routes/admin.ts 37-39,90-92,107-109,125-127,136-138,149-151,165-167,186-188,202-204,225-227,244-245; routes/auth.ts 84-86,123-125,145-147,161-163,186-188,200-202; routes/extensions.ts 218-229,237-248,256-267; routes/github.ts 120-133,138-161,166-195,249-251,262-264,266-272,274-275,283-290,295-380,385-444,449-466; routes/groups.ts 28-30,60-62,101-103,125-127,143-145,195-197,232-234; routes/oidc.ts 46-52,65-78,91-108,147-152,154-156,163-188,192-247; routes/pm.ts 42-55,71-74,82-93,104-107,167-169,182-184,187-189,191-194,207-213,226-237,287-394,422-452,458,481-484,557-561,592-593,603,766-768,786-788,879-881,916-950,1178-1238,1401-1403,1432-1434,1452-1454,1464-1466,1479-1501,1506-1533,1538-1562,1567-1590,1595-1604,1609-1625,1630-1644,1649-1663,1668-1682,1687-1701,1706-1715,1720-1739,1744-1752,1757-1765,1770-1785,1790-1807,1812-1828,1833-1841,1846-1854,1859-1877,1882-1890,1895-1904,1909-1919,1937-1939,1945-1970,1972-2008,2018-2070,2075-2120,2128-2198,2203-2211,2216-2239,2244-2256,2261-2268,2273-2276,2281-2284,2289-2292,2297-2300,2305-2309,2314-2323,2342-2365,2384-2406,2411-2421,2426-2443,2448-2465,2470-2489,2494-2511,2516-2533,2538-2558,2563-2580,2585-2602,2607-2625,2630-2653,2658-2678,2683-2701,2709-2718,2722-2736,2741-2758,2768-2771,2784-2787,2804-2809; routes/projects.ts 78-80,117-129,137-139,152-154,172-174,191-19